# 🛒 Souqna (سوقنا)

Souqna is a modern Arabic classifieds marketplace inspired by Divar and designed for Arabic-speaking countries.

## ✨ Features

- RTL Arabic interface
- Responsive design
- Search bar
- Categories
- Latest ads section
- Add Ad button
- Login & Register pages
- Ready for Node.js backend integration

